        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Browse the enchant-glass",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "glass_rack"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "rack_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Ask about the mushrooms",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "spore_lore"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "spores_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Enjoy the view",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You climbed all the way up. Good — the shop only works on people who look up. I used to mend the high roofs and blow lantern glass down there. Then the mushrooms moved into my kiln loft and started, well, explaining things. Now I seal workings into glass. Same sand, same breath, better conversations."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Before you browse anything else: Depth Strider. This town is half water and every road out of it is wetter. Seal that to your boots and the flooded paths carry you like dry boardwalk. I am not upselling you. I am keeping your name off the drowned list, which is a real list, and the diviner keeps it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Every lantern on that boardwalk started in my little kiln. These days I fire something stronger — a book of glass with a working sealed inside. Lysira keeps the dark honest with light. I keep it honest with inventory."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You can still see the Company site from here — the grey scab on the green. They would call my spore method proprietary fermentation and invoice the marsh for its own fog. Buy your glass from a man the mushrooms actually like."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thalorin Wispbrook",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Depth Strider II — 1200 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_ench_depthstrider2"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_ench_depthstrider2_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Unbreaking III — 1500 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_ench_unbreaking3"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_ench_unbreaking3_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Protection II — 1000 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_ench_protection2"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_ench_protection2_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Efficiency III — 900 CD",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/market/buy_ench_efficiency3"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "buy_ench_efficiency3_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Back to Thalorin",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The rack. Four workings I can seal reliably, priced by how much glass survives the sealing. The Depth Strider is the one this marsh was born for — walk the flooded routes like planks and stop budgeting your breath. Unbreaking if you love a tool, Protection if you love yourself, Efficiency if you are in a hurry, which up here nobody is."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thalorin — the enchant-glass rack",
                    Label: "glass_rack"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Back to Thalorin",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The mushrooms grow in the old kiln loft, right where the heat pools. They hum when a batch of glass is ready to take a working — a little chord, like wet wine glasses. The diviner says I have simply learned to smell the sealing temperature. The diviner does not sleep up here. The mushrooms hum."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Once — once — a cap came up glowing in a script I could very nearly read. I copied it onto a lantern before it faded. That lantern has never gone out. I do not sell that one. Some stock is colleagues. No, I do not eat them either. You do not eat your colleagues."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thalorin — on the mushrooms",
                    Label: "spore_lore"
                }
            ]
        },
